WEBVTT

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:14.680
Nee-chan.

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:15.940
What?

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:19.310
I guess we're going to the 
department store. Wanna come?

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:22.320
I'll pass.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.240
Are you sure?

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:26.880
Can you stay home all by your widdle self?

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:30.040
You're making fun of me, aren't you?

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:32.340
You might get attacked 
by ghosts or something.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:33.290
Okay, listen!

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:36.990
"Ghosts" are just silly 
explanations people give for fun

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:39.270
when a lot of coincidences happen at once!

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:42.620
Why would I be afraid of 
something that's made up?

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:44.320
I'm not a child!

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:47.830
In fact, I'm your <i>older</i> sister!

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:49.270
Don't treat me like I'm stupid!

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:52.270
I didn't expect you to 
take it that seriously.

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:54.750
Well, watch out for ghosts, then.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.010
It's still daytime! There won't be any!

00:00:57.010 --> 00:01:00.260
But zashiki warashi come out 
during the day, don't they?

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:03.450
Well, see ya later.

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:07.580
Sheesh...

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:30.480
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:41.510
<b>Episode 9</b>

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:41.510
<b>We Made Tasty Food</b>

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:56.140
I'm hungry.

00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:03.050
I swear, that Natsumi...

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:05.230
She treats me like a little kid.

00:03:05.670 --> 00:03:07.190
There's not gonna be any gho—

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:17.260
You can't fool me!

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:21.100
Ghosts don't come out during 
the day. That's nonsense.

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:29.200
E-Eek!

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:31.860
A weasel got into the house!

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:36.320
Crazy that we ran into each other 
on the street like this, huh?

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.000
Were you two out playing?

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:41.100
Well, we were thinking of 
inviting you guys to join us.

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:44.740
Oh, then why don't I call the 
others and see if they can come?

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:46.980
I'd appreciate that.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:50.180
I can't believe it got away...

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:53.160
I should've closed the kitchen door.

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:56.010
Where'd it go?

00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:00.040
J-Just the phone...

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:03.040
Jeez, don't scare me like that.

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.900
Hello?

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:09.210
Aw, I lost my signal.

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:11.710
I guess it'll be hard to 
call them from the road.

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:15.500
My house is close. We can 
call them from there.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:16.930
Yeah, let's go.

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:19.260
A silent call?

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:22.690
Who would do that?

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:26.380
But... I can't be bothered 
with that right now.

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:28.570
I didn't think...

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:32.090
you'd show yourself to me like this!

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:35.440
Stay there, stay there...

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:38.240
Don't move...

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:44.510
I'll go get us something to drink.

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:45.680
Okay.

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:48.220
I'll call Komari-chan.

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:52.190
Hey, hey, Konomi-nee, are you 
watching that one thing?

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.820
What thing?

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:56.490
The TV show with lots of dogs.

00:04:56.490 --> 00:05:00.240
It had puppies, too. It was really cute!

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:02.180
Oh, that?

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:06.770
Wh-Why is this weasel
standing perfectly still?

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:10.650
Don't you know the first one 
to move loses? So just move!

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:15.210
Th-The phone again?

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:17.830
That prank call earlier, 
and now this? Who <i>is</i> it?

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:19.790
I'm coming...

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:21.080
Hello?

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:22.610
<i>I'm watching.</i>

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:28.690
W-Wait... Was that silent call earlier...

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:31.600
one of the daytime ghosts 
Natsumi was talking about?

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:36.550
And there's a weasel watching me, 
just like this call said...

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:45.710
I get it now!

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:49.940
You're some kind of ghost weasel 
that sends messages via phone?!

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:52.890
No! This is just a bunch 
of coincidences at once!

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:54.420
There's no such thing as ghosts!

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:57.080
Natsumi would laugh at me for this!

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:59.160
I'm gonna catch you, no matter what!

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:07.640
Ow...

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:30.660
I see.

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:35.470
So after all those things happened, 
you decided to hide here.

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.070
I get it now.

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:41.130
This is how zashiki warashi stories happen.

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:43.080
I'm not a warashi!

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:51.090
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:14.810
Why are you making that face while knitting?

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:17.900
Huh? Was I making a weird face?

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:19.430
<i>Super</i> weird.

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:21.350
What's wrong? Did something happen?

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:23.340
Well...

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:28.530
Hotaru and I agreed we'd knit 
a present for each other...

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:33.340
But we're supposed to exchange them 
today, and I can't get anything done.

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:35.800
Do something, Natsumi!

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:38.230
I helped you with your homework last time!

00:07:38.230 --> 00:07:41.850
Uh, I don't know what you 
want me to do about it...

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:46.250
You've got a whole pile of 
knitted things on the floor.

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:47.160
What about them?

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:50.690
They're... the ones I 
did manage to finish...

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:53.770
Hey, you did get something made, then.

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:54.870
What's this?

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:57.420
Uh, it's a sweater...

00:07:57.420 --> 00:07:59.880
Yeah? Can I try it on?

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:01.700
S-Sure.

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:08.180
Huh?

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:13.420
There's no hole to put my head through.

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:16.630
Yeah. I forgot to make one.

00:08:17.030 --> 00:08:18.320
Come on!

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:20.780
This isn't a sweater! It's long johns!

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:23.230
I just wore long johns on my head!

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:26.050
It's not long johns! It's a sweater!

00:08:26.050 --> 00:08:28.030
I was trying to make a sweater!

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:33.910
If Hotaru sees this, my dignity as 
her senpai will be shattered...

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:37.090
Huh? Uh, I don't think you 
had that to begin with...

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.900
Senpai!

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:45.240
I'm here.

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:46.870
Oh... G-Good morning.

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:50.480
Uh, so... about the knitting...

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:51.350
Yeah!

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:55.200
I made a sweater for you, Senpai!

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:57.690
Oh, and that's not all I made!

00:08:57.690 --> 00:09:00.890
I made a knit hat and some mittens, too!

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:03.980
W-Wow, you made so much...

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:07.410
I'm... so happy. Thank you, Hotaru.

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:08.800
Really?!

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:11.810
I'm so glad you like them!

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:16.480
Natsumi, help!

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:18.210
Huh?

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:23.710
Uh... You sure are good 
at knitting, Hotarun.

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:27.250
But you know what? 
My sister's right up there, too!

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:30.340
She made all kinds of things for you!

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:32.070
What? Really?

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:33.710
But of course!

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:35.180
Like this!

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:38.780
What do you think it is? 
It looks like a sweater, right?

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:41.890
<i>W-Wait... She's not gonna say 
it's long johns, is she?!</i>

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:46.280
It's actually... fluffy leggings 
that'll keep you warm even in winter!

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:50.470
L-Leggings? Those seem like 
they'd be hard to make...

00:09:50.470 --> 00:09:55.370
Yes! Since they're made of yarn, 
they're the perfect leg warmers!

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:57.600
Oh, wow!

00:09:57.600 --> 00:10:00.600
Senpai, are you sure I can have these?

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:04.570
Huh? Uh, yeah... If you 
want them, they're yours.

00:10:14.850 --> 00:10:17.070
And that's not all!

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:20.330
Nee-chan's got lots of other 
things here for you, too!

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:23.480
The next item to jump out of 
this pile of knitting is...

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.940
This!

00:10:30.430 --> 00:10:32.610
<i>Uh... What is this?</i>

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:35.330
Um... What is...

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:39.170
Er... It's, um... a ball...

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:41.760
No, actually, it's...

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:47.740
The top part of Tsutenkaku.

00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:56.620
I'm kidding! It's a ball!

00:10:56.850 --> 00:10:59.060
You have a dog, right?

00:10:59.060 --> 00:11:01.580
It's a ball meant to be a dog toy!

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:03.950
But you don't want it to 
get stuck in his throat,

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:07.230
so just use it as a decoration 
that <i>looks</i> like a dog toy!

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:10.100
Uh... so... the Tsutenkaku thing...

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:12.390
That was just a joke!

00:11:12.390 --> 00:11:15.630
It doesn't look anything like 
the top of Tsutenkaku, right?

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:17.720
If you take a joke like that seriously,

00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:20.410
my pain will mount as high 
as Tsutenkaku itself!

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:21.570
Uh-huh...

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:25.070
So... uh...

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:30.030
We've still got more knitted goods!

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:30.490
Huh?!

00:11:30.490 --> 00:11:32.700
The last thing I have to show you is...

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:36.410
<i>Gimme something to bounce 
back from that last one!</i>

00:11:37.270 --> 00:11:38.200
This!

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:44.640
<i>Yep. We're done.</i>

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:47.890
Uh... What is it?

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:50.430
Um, it's...

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:53.330
A scarf! Yeah! It's a scarf!

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:59.360
A cutting-edge scarf with a bunch of tube 
bits that let in air for insulation!

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:02.250
Um... ah...

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:04.480
Hotaru!

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:07.500
The thing is...

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:11.830
I really tried to knit some things,

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:13.910
but none of them came out right.

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:19.120
The thing she called "leggings" was supposed 
to be a sweater, but I messed it up.

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:23.260
So, Hotaru... I'm sorry I didn't tell you!

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:33.770
But... you did make all these 
by yourself, didn't you?

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:38.230
Just knitting one thing 
takes such a long time.

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:44.360
I'm really happy just knowing 
you made all these for me!

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:46.160
Thank you, Senpai!

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:50.770
H-Hotaru!

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:54.820
Okay, next time you knit something, 
let's do it together.

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:57.280
I can show you what to do if 
it's something I know about.

00:12:57.280 --> 00:12:59.220
O-Okay!

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:03.380
Sorry for asking you to do 
all that, too, Natsumi.

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:08.030
Nah. Of course I'm gonna help out 
my big sister when she needs it.

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:09.270
It's fine.

00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:13.480
Now, about those long johns!

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:15.460
Huh? Long johns?

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:23.990
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:37.880
So...

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:42.830
I was thinking of making our dinner tonight.

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:53.750
What?! So we don't get any dinner tonight?!

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:56.220
Why are you already ruling out eating it?!

00:13:56.220 --> 00:13:58.200
Well, I mean,

00:13:58.200 --> 00:14:00.680
you just tried to make gratin 
not long ago and destroyed it!

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:03.510
You forgot to season it, 
and it just tasted burnt!

00:14:03.510 --> 00:14:05.190
It was flavorless burn-tin!

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:06.880
Have you forgotten that?!

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:09.980
N-No, I remember it, but...

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:13.590
I just forgot to add some 
seasoning, that's all.

00:14:13.590 --> 00:14:18.490
And I thought the charred parts 
would make it more savory...

00:14:18.490 --> 00:14:20.880
Carbonized and savory aren't the same!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:24.650
O-Okay, then, you can just 
have Nii-chan help you.

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:25.870
Then it should be safe.

00:14:25.870 --> 00:14:30.080
No! When he helps, he just 
does everything by himself!

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:31.540
It's no fun that way!

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:35.170
Don't destroy an entire meal 
of Natsumi-chan's for fun!

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:38.240
What's all the yelling about, you two?

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:41.540
Nee-chan is trying to poison us all!

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:42.680
Please help!

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:45.820
Oh, so Komari's cooking?

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:46.900
Sounds good to me.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.010
What?!

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:51.500
Your own daughter is trying to 
poison your other daughter!

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:53.670
Even a growing girl can't handle poison!

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:57.440
Oh, and Mom, don't try to help me, okay?

00:14:57.440 --> 00:14:59.010
I wanna do it myself.

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:01.420
Fine, fine. I won't help you.

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:05.510
Anyway, Natsumi, could you pass 
this bulletin on to the neighbors?

00:15:05.510 --> 00:15:09.040
Uh... I have homework, though...

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:13.760
You decide to show an interest 
in your homework <i>now</i>?

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:17.410
All right, fine. Nii-chan, would you?

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:20.730
Okay, I'm going to do the laundry.

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:24.730
Her whole family's dinner is in danger, 
and she shirks all responsibility...

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:27.260
And she calls herself a mother?

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:31.480
Look, you're belittling me 
way too much, even for you.

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:35.920
Huh? I thought I was actually holding back.

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:38.970
No, you were belittling me a lot!

00:15:39.280 --> 00:15:42.340
Okay, then! If that's what 
you think, just watch!

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:46.410
I'm gonna make an amazing meal this 
time and show you what I can do!

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:50.880
<i>Oh, man. Nothing ever goes 
well after a line like that.</i>

